  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">JP Syria Urban and Rural Resilience</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The United Nations Joint Programme to Build Urban and Rural Resilience and the Conditions for Recovery in Syria creates an opening for stakeholders to respond to the needs of people and their communities through recovery and resilience efforts in the areas of basic social service provision, improved livelihoods, social cohesion, and addressing local causes of conflict.</narrative>
  </description>
